1
00:00:00,757 --> 00:00:03,387
(Bernadette:)The next person kicking you
will be me.

2
00:00:03,393 --> 00:00:04,343
(Bernadette:)Good night.

3
00:00:10,817 --> 00:00:12,817
(Howard:)Are we even
in a good school...?

4
00:00:12,819 --> 00:00:14,019
(Howard:)Ow!

5
00:00:15,105 --> 00:00:18,605
(Bernadette:)I warned you,
and I did it.

6
00:00:22,912 --> 00:00:24,112
(Penny:)What's all this?

7
00:00:24,114 --> 00:00:26,694
(Leonard:)Oh, everything we need
for your autograph session--

8
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:28,330
(Leonard:)head shots, markers.
Okay.

9
00:00:28,335 --> 00:00:30,035
(Penny:)Leonard, it's sweet
you're excited about this,

10
00:00:30,036 --> 00:00:33,176
(Penny:)but it'll be a miracle if one
person asks for my autograph.

11
00:00:33,173 --> 00:00:34,343
(Leonard:)Are you kidding?

12
00:00:34,341 --> 00:00:36,621
I once paid $20
for Theo Sassler's signature.

13
00:00:36,626 --> 00:00:37,876
- Who's that?
- Oh, I don't even know.

14
00:00:37,877 --> 00:00:40,677
(Leonard:)I just liked his name.
Theo Sassler!

15
00:00:41,631 --> 00:00:43,511
Oh, and look at this.

16
00:00:43,516 --> 00:00:45,716
(Leonard:)I even got a change maker.

17
00:00:49,472 --> 00:00:51,772
(Leonard:)How much change you want,
little lady?

18
00:00:53,059 --> 00:00:56,399
(Penny:)Oh, there's so much
I want to change.

19
00:00:56,396 --> 00:01:04,026
(Leonard:)Yeah, well, if it's a dollar,
you're in luck.

